We were going to hell.

01:19:06.750 --> 01:19:08.050
You weren't right.

01:19:09.050 --> 01:19:12.350
Order was restored to the world together.

01:19:14.750 --> 01:19:19.257
Today,
man did everything you, even

01:19:19.299 --> 01:19:24.730
backwards man,
awkwardly twisted decades of

01:19:24.730 --> 01:19:25.470
your lives on.

01:19:28.350 --> 01:19:33.074
They reshaped your kind
back to their rightful place

01:19:33.116 --> 01:19:37.340
in the shadows and killed ourselves,
the Nazis.

01:19:59.190 --> 01:20:00.930
Looks like mine was more effective.

01:20:01.650 --> 01:20:02.010
Hm.

01:20:03.790 --> 01:20:05.770
Now, who's done wrong?

01:20:25.230 --> 01:20:29.133
Director Baker's
intentions when she

01:20:29.175 --> 01:20:33.970
deployed agents who
imported the wolf's lair?

01:20:34.170 --> 01:20:35.070
Not exactly, no.

01:20:36.690 --> 01:20:40.122
What I perceived to be Director
Baker's intentions were entirely

01:20:40.164 --> 01:20:43.690
in line with the investigation we
had been carrying out for years.

01:20:44.450 --> 01:20:53.060
And it wasn't until one of our agents was
compromised, we had a basic recon mission.

01:20:53.920 --> 01:20:56.545
And that's when you became
aware of the information

01:20:56.587 --> 01:20:59.200
that Baker had been
withholding from her superiors.

01:20:59.580 --> 01:21:00.460
That's correct, yes.

01:21:03.440 --> 01:21:04.160
Great mistake.

01:21:04.280 --> 01:21:06.880
I went back to my office
and I immediately contacted...

01:21:12.800 --> 01:21:13.180
Yes, sir?

01:21:21.640 --> 01:21:23.840
An authorization to send
agent Rigby to Poland.

01:21:26.000 --> 01:21:26.940
An authorization, sir?

01:21:28.380 --> 01:21:30.906
If you were, in fact,
under the impression that

01:21:30.948 --> 01:21:33.460
a standard recon mission
was being conducted...

01:21:43.350 --> 01:21:47.207
That she was being sent into
the lion's den without appropriating

01:21:47.249 --> 01:21:50.320
what I thought was best
for the safety of my agents.

01:21:55.480 --> 01:21:59.019
Would you say that
what you did resulted in

01:21:59.061 --> 01:22:02.640
what was best for the
safety of your agents?

01:22:02.640 --> 01:22:04.820
The agents believed in
something bigger than themselves.

01:22:05.360 --> 01:22:07.300
And they laid their lives on the line,
that's for sure.

01:22:12.840 --> 01:22:14.851
Their actions resulted
in what was best for the

01:22:14.893 --> 01:22:17.200
safety of the nation and
all nations around the globe.

01:22:25.010 --> 01:22:26.490
Please answer what was asked of you.

01:22:27.670 --> 01:22:31.430
Did your actions result in what was
best for the safety of your agents?

01:22:31.950 --> 01:22:32.410
No, sir.

01:22:39.380 --> 01:22:39.980
May I ask a question?

01:22:41.206 --> 01:22:42.498
Yes go ahead.

01:22:43.949 --> 01:22:46.224
Was Becky Hopper body ever recovered ?
